# Elite Dev Toolchain

## Canonical dev commands (repo root)

| Command | Use |
|---------|-----|
| `pnpm dev` | **Default** — full Tauri desktop (Rust + Next on :3000) |
| `pnpm dev:ui` | Next-only in browser; native commands unavailable |
| `pnpm dev:web` | Marketing site (:3001) |
| `pnpm dev:all` | Web + Tauri + `@repo/ui` watchers |

Do not start a second Next server on :3000 alongside `pnpm dev`.

## Validation before merge

```bash
pnpm ops:validate:local
```

Includes arch check, lint, types, `pnpm test:parity`, `pnpm test:hardening`, build.

